---
{/*
  A fake scrollbar for panelled chapters.

  The native one had to be hidden: a vertical bar on the first screen of a
  chapter contradicts the horizontal continuity the path sets up. But a real
  scrollbar occupies layout, so revealing it on descent shifted the content.
  This one is fixed and floats over the chapter, so it can appear and disappear
  for free.

  Purely a position readout — the rail carries navigation, and there is nothing
  to drag here — so it is hidden from assistive technology.
*/}
---

<div class="depth-indicator" data-depth-indicator data-state="idle" aria-hidden="true">
  <span></span>
</div>
